summary: Pickle juice adds a special tang. From Cooking With Country Music Stars (1986).
---

> Pickle juice adds a special tang to Dolly's delicious coleslaw.
> Preparation time: 10 to 12 minutes. Serves 10 to 12.
>
> *From COOKING WITH COUNTRY MUSIC STARS.
> Copyright © 1986 Marmac Publishing Company, Inc., Atlanta, Georgia.*

Chop @cabbage{1%medium head} and place in a large #bowl{}.

Finely chop @onion{1%medium} and add to the bowl.

Chop or grate @carrot{1} and add to the bowl.

Finely chop @bell pepper{0.5} and add to the bowl.

Chop @dill pickle{1} (or measure @pickle relish{1%tbsp}) and add to the bowl.

Sprinkle @sugar{2%tsp}, @black pepper{0.25%tsp}, and @salt{1%tsp} over the vegetables.

Pour @sweet pickle juice{0.25%cup} and @white vinegar{0.25%cup} over the mixture.

Add @mayonnaise{1%cup}.

Toss everything together until well combined.

Refrigerate until ready to serve.
